   "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:normal;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:start;text-transform:none;text-shadow:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;direction:ltr;text-indent:0px;display:block;width:100%\"><h5 style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">Willkommen bei Dreifaldt-Tennis</span></span></h5>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><br>\n<span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">Hier finden Sie sämtliche Infofly</span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">er samt der dazugehörigen Anmeldeformulare der Tennisschule. &nbsp;Dies beinhaltet Gruppen-, Einzel- oder Privatunterricht, &nbsp;Junioren- und KIDS, Clubinterne (von der Tennisschule organisierte) Turniere, Events und Feriencamps.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\"><span>​</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">Klicken Sie einfach nebenan auf das gewünschte Feld, und es ist zum Download bereit.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\"><span>​</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">Falls Fragen auftauchen sollten, kann unten auch eine Mitteilung mit Euren Kontaktdaten abgesendet werden, auf die wir uns entweder per Mail oder auch telefonisch melden würden.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\"><span>​</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">Mit allerbesten Grüssen</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\"><span><span>​</span>​</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\"><span>​</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif\">Hansi Dreifaldt</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:&quot;open sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgb(99, 99, 99);text-align:center\"><span><span><span style=\"font-fami